  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#f00\"><strong>本模组仅支持1.20.4-1.21.1版本。适用于NeoForge的新版本已<a style=\"color:#f00\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-better-desert-temples\" rel=\"nofollow\">迁移至此</a>。</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/NedZCVu.png\" alt=\"YUNG优化版沙漠神殿\" width=\"1344\" height=\"416\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-api-neoforge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungsapibadge\" alt=\"依赖YUNG's API\" width=\"211\" height=\"26\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/rns3beq\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungsdiscordbadge2\" alt=\"加入YUNG帮派Discord！\" width=\"136\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://twitter.com/yungnickyoung\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungstwitterbadge3\" alt=\"关注我的Twitter！\" width=\"76\" height=\"27\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCmEhjcMNhSDTRJgjVfbs9Rw\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungsyoutubebadge\" alt=\"订阅我的YouTube！\" width=\"80\" height=\"30\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://patreon.com/yungnickyoung\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungspatreonbadge\" alt=\"在Patreon支持我！\" width=\"138\" height=\"28\"></a></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2HNgRET.png\" alt=\"模组介绍\" width=\"1125\" height=\"59\"></p><p>Minecraft沙漠神殿的终极升级！YUNG优化版沙漠神殿对原版结构进行全面重制，新增多样化的机关谜题、致命陷阱与跑酷挑战。当然，作为冒险的回报，战利品品质将远超原版！</p><p>默认情况下，所有进入优化版沙漠神殿的玩家都会获得挖掘疲劳效果。当您成功通关神殿（即击败尽头的法老boss后），该神殿的挖掘疲劳效果将永久解除！此功能可通过配置文件禁用。您还可以在配置中启用原版沙漠神殿与优化版共存生成。</p><p><strong><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/C1C5Z0DaOQk?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></strong></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/JR6R3uf.png\" alt=\"兼容性说明\" width=\"1125\" height=\"59\"></p><p>YUNG优化版沙漠神殿与主流世界生成模组完全兼容，包括：</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-better-strongholds-neoforge\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG优化版要塞</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-better-mineshafts-neoforge\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG优化版废弃矿井</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-better-dungeons-neoforge\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG优化版地牢</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-extras-neoforge\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG扩展包</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-bridges-neoforge\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG优化版桥梁</a></li>\n<li>Repurposed Structures模组。该模组还提供配套数据包，可生成重构版的沙漠神殿！<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/repurposed-structures-better-desert-temples-compat\" rel=\"nofollow\">点此查看详情</a></li>\n</ul><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fessential.gg%252fx%252fyung\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2mVOWMC.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1230\" height=\"241\"></a></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/a49IMQJ.png\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fyung\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/nQRs7ZP.png\" alt=\"使用优惠码YUNGNICKYOUNG可享Bisect Hosting七五折！\" width=\"1344\" height=\"400\"></a></p>",
